===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|xno}} legal phrase {{term|hu e cri|lang=fro}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''[[hue]] and [[cry]]'''

# {{historical}} The [[public]] [[pursuit]] of a [[felon]]; accompanied by [[shout]]s to warn others to [[give chase]].
# {{context|by extension}} A [[loud]] and [[persistent]] public [[clamour]]; especially one of [[protest]] or making some [[demand]].

